            </div>
            <div class="debate-side">
              <strong>More cautious</strong>
              <p>Rapid automation brings uncertainty about jobs, hidden vulnerabilities, and whether responsible use can keep pace with new capability.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

